UQ&oe=6AFB42FE"}, {"file_name": "screenshot1.png", "id": "1258496455414508", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820652_1258496458747841_372527930410987345_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D4MuQnmjrEAQ7kNvwF4XmIr&_nc_oc=Adp2qxXzR3vU-ItPKHKC-3ea3WcuBEFY14Afza217IgnM0ebpk1HeL0FXtTIQIy6l5Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS5-MT3m2xDIh_pRVaK4nBOAZHyCbz9k3aR1mumYH5iMw&oe=6AFB34AD"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-2.png", "id": "1864836307641632", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818900_1864836310974965_748400959475714348_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0IeaH3-qox4Q7kNvwG-PGuS&_nc_oc=Adrxe0-hPPUrpbxWSOM3HgguFJ9_cgdFDNwS7I2nxFm3NbcV0fU2T21PVV6YY92B8Tc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQgdM75BUPEjx2r85kiuv7GmyLD9-uC4gkaU6oAkpbbtw&oe=6AFB3648"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Lawn Bowling VR", "keywords": ["bowling", "bowls", "lawn", "sport", "simulation"], "long_description": "# VR Lawn Bowls: Own the Green\n\nStep onto the green in **virtual reality** and feel every delivery. Read the line, fight the wind, and chase the perfect end across Singles, Pairs, Triples, and Fours.\n\n# Beat the Best\n\nFive AI difficulty levels stand between you and glory, from a gentle warm-up to a pro who punishes loose bowls.\n\n# Bring Your Friends\n\nJump into remote games with names, avatars, and **voice chat** with live speaking indicators. Weather, wet green patches, and auto-bowl settings stay in sync, so every player faces the same green.\n\n# The Green Fights Back\n\nWind bends your line, rain slickens the surface, and wet patches drag your bowl short. Dial in rink length, pick your rink, or unleash **Free Mode** with no boundary, any mat position, and total jack freedom.\n\n# Bowl Your Way\n\nTracked hands and fingers, or a **bowling arm** for supported delivery. The **aim guide** maps your line, bias width runs from Straight to Unreasonably Wide, and the **B button** flips bias on the fly.\n\nSix bowl patterns, team colour rings, and rank markers let you bowl in style.\n\n# Learn Fast\n\nThe **tutorial system** gets you bowling in minutes, while the wrist UI shows the current head and hands you auto-bowl controls tuned to your speed and angle.\n\n# Built for Quest\n\nDynamic resolution, higher refresh rates, and settings that stick between sessions. Your game saves after every bowl.\n\nThink you can hold the shot? The green is waiting.", "short_description": "Step onto the green in VR and master lawn bowls. Read the line, fight wind and rain, and chase the perfect end across Singles, Pairs, Triples, and Fours. Face five AI levels from beginner to pro, or team up online with player avatars and voice chat. Dial in rink length, switch on Free Mode, and bowl your way with tracked hands, a bowling arm, and an aim guide. Six patterns, team colour rings, rank markers, and a full tutorial. Your game saves after every bowl. Think you can hold the shot?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://lawn-bowling-vr.vercel.app/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Flat Green Studios", "support_website_url": "https://lawn-bowling-vr.vercel.app/support.html", "website_url": "https://lawn-bowling-vr.vercel.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"