{"__typename": "Application", "id": "24501395546116027", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29768957539359775"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1060035295979017"}]}, "change_log": "# Release Notes\n\n## v0.10.6 - 7 October 2026\n\n### Added\n- Voice activity indicators so you can see which players are speaking in multiplayer games\n- Weather and surface moisture now sync across all players in multiplayer games\n- Caps lock now turns on automatically for the multiplayer join code keyboard\n\n### Changed\n- Bowls and jacks now slow down more on the wetter parts of the green\n\n### Fixed\n- Free Mode mat not rotating to face the jack in multiplayer games\n- Controllers not driving hand and finger movement in multiplayer games\n- Avatar mouths not moving when players speak in multiplayer games\n\n## v0.10.5 - 24 September 2026\n\n### Added\n- Player names and avatars now display correctly for every player in multiplayer games\n- Auto-bowl controls on the wrist UI, with speed and angle preferences that sync across players\n\n### Changed\n- Bowl and jack camera tracking now runs locally, removing per-frame network traffic\n- Error reports now respect the data collection opt-out setting\n\n### Fixed\n- Clients not being disconnected or removed from the session when the host disconnects\n- Leaving clients being replaced with AI\n- Game being locked when a client leaves during their turn\n- Clients not being sent back to the menu area after leaving a game\n- Players being added to the game voice channel if they disconnect while joining\n- Player list and player dropdowns not updating correctly in multiplayer rooms\n- Clients who left or closed the app before the game started not being removed\n- Newly joined clients not being picked up by a host returning from low power\n- Jack, coin and scoreboard not displaying correctly when a client rejoins an active game\n- Multiplayer objects and UI falling back to single player behaviour while a client reconnects\n- A player's bowl not resetting when dropped on the mat\n- Touched bowls in the ditch being removed incorrectly\n- Dead bowl detection for bowls outside the rink, in the ditch, and short bowls\n- Jack ownership not returning to the first delivering team after an incorrect delivery\n- Distance circles not updating when the jack is repositioned\n- Bowl spawn angle not accounting for a rotated mat in Free Mode\n- Coin flip animation not playing due to a stale current end value\n- Opening coin remaining visible after the first end started\n- Wrist displays not following the controller or hiding with it\n- Wrist settings toggles only hiding the toggle instead of the whole labelled row\n- Rink boundary showing in non-regular game modes\n- Voice chat volume adjustments not using the joined channel\n- Scoreboard end text not clearing between ends\n- Single player names not being remembered in the create game menu\n\n## v0.10.4 - 22 May 2026\n\n### Added\n- Club logo wall to clubrooms\n\n## v0.10.3 - 12 May 2026\n\n### Added\n- Dynamic resolution support\n- \"B\" button in-game to change bias direction\n\n### Fixed\n- Bowl drop ending player's turn incorrectly\n- Interaction bug with the new mat\n\n## v0.10.2 - 30 April 2026\n\n### Added\n- Wind support in multiplayer games\n\n## v0.10.1 - 26 April 2026\n\n### Added\n- Higher refresh rate support in settings\n\n## v0.10.0 - 21 April 2026\n\n### Added\n- Remote multiplayer functionality\n\n## v0.9.3 - 28 April 2026\n\n### Added\n- Beta request form\n\n## v0.9.2 - 1 April 2026\n\n### Added\n- User Age Group API call to comply with app store requirements\n\n## v0.9.0 - 17 October 2025\n\n### Added\n- Tutorial system\n- Game settings persistence between sessions\n\n### Fixed\n- Active bowls from loaded games being grabbable\n- Player position reset when not in a game\n\n## v0.8.0 - 22 September 2025\n\n### Added\n- Weather system with wind, rain, and sun effects\n- Dynamic sound volumes based on bowl/jack speed\n- Four plain color bowl patterns\n- Optional jack target\n- End result display\n\n### Changed\n- Menus no longer reposition to always face the player\n\n### Fixed\n- Saving games with dead bowls\n- Bowling arm usage not being saved\n- Aim guide placement on bank shots\n- Player reset position handling\n\n### Known Issues\n- AI bowls are not affected by wind or rain due to performance constraints\n\n## v0.7.0 - 29 August 2025\n\n### Added\n- Free Mode - removes rink boundary, allows mat placement anywhere on the green, and unrestricted jack delivery\n\n## v0.6.0 - 15 August 2025\n\n### Added\n- Bowling arms support\n- Jack reset when it stops less than 3m from mat\n- Incorrect delivery detection for jack released more than 2m in front of mat\n- Daily feature voting system\n\n### Fixed\n- Bowl bias for left-handed players starting an end\n- Game loading with undelivered jack\n- Jack grab during AI turn\n\n## v0.5.0 - 7 August 2025\n\n### Added\n- Recalculated Pro AI for improved accuracy\n- Adjustable rink length\n- Rink selection\n- Aim guide adjustment for bias width\n\n### Fixed\n- Bowl movement when hit after loading from save\n- Bowl stopping correctly on load\n\n## v0.4.1 - 22 July 2025\n\n### Added\n- Bowl pattern selector with 6 options\n- Feedback form\n\n### Fixed\n- Data collection toggles and delete button functionality - all usage data has been removed from the database\n\n## v0.4.0 - 21 July 2025\n\n### Added\n- Team color rings on bowls\n- Rank numbers above bowls after they stop moving\n- Current head display on wrist UI\n- Configurable bias width from \"Straight\" to \"Unreasonably Wide\"\n- Usage data collection and error reporting\n\n## v0.3.0 - 7 July 2025\n\n### Added\n- Main menu with user profiles\n- Settings menu with ground level reset, background volume, rink boundary toggle, movement vignette, and smooth turning options\n- Local game save after each bowl for resume capability\n- Aim guide for green alignment\n\n### Fixed\n- Gyroscopic presession for left-handed players", "created_date": 1791343075, "id": "29768957539359775", "version": "0.10.6", "version_code": 24, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24501395546116027", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29768957539359775"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1790221689, "id": "29600869289501935", "version": "0.10.5", "version_code": 23, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24501395546116027", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29768957539359775"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1779424496, "id": "28018711214384425", "version": "0.10.4", "version_code": 22, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24501395546116027", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29768957539359775"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1778562075, "id": "27887754064146808", "version": "0.10.3", "version_code": 21, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}